VisualForge

A skill suite for generating opinionated, detail-obsessed design systems for
Codex and Claude Code.

Companion to Specforge (https://github.com/specforge). Specforge handles
product, architecture, and security documentation. VisualForge handles design.

The two integrate when both are present: shared decision-log ID space,
namespaced output directories (docs/app-plan/ for Specforge, docs/design-system/
for VisualForge), and Specforge's basic UI output is treated as input context
that VisualForge can replace with a deeper design system.
